\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.21}{\ignorespaces The four relative pointing degrees of freedom for the beam into the PMC was measured with the DBB. The requirement \cite  {PSL_pointing_requirement} is shown in light blue. The pointing noise is above the requirement, however the TnT lab has a higher amount of environmental noise than the PSL. Measurements below 200\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}Hz were be affected by scattering.\relax }}{81}{figure.caption.94}}
\newlabel{fig:ligolaserchapterpointingnoise}{{3.21}{81}{The four relative pointing degrees of freedom for the beam into the PMC was measured with the DBB. The requirement \cite {PSL_pointing_requirement} is shown in light blue. The pointing noise is above the requirement, however the TnT lab has a higher amount of environmental noise than the PSL. Measurements below 200\,Hz were be affected by scattering.\relax }{figure.caption.94}{}}
